{"seq":1,"slug":"immutability-collections","title":"不可变与集合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/scala-language/functional/immutability-collections","wordCount":1219,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"不可变与集合\">不可变与集合</h1><p>Scala 程序员每天打交道最多的，既不是 trait 也不是隐式，而是集合。一个有经验的判断标准是：当你能熟练地用 <code>map</code>、<code>filter</code>、<code>groupBy</code>、<code>fold</code> 把一段命令式循环改写成一连串数据变换时，你才算真正进入了 Scala 的思维方式。而这一切的前提是「不可变默认」——Scala 集合库的设计假设你不会就地修改数据，而是不断产生新的、共享底层结构的版本。本篇讲清这套集合体系与让它高效的持久化数据结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Scala 集合库分成两条平行的继承线：<code>scala.collection.immutable</code>（不可变，默认导入、默认推荐）和 <code>scala.collection.mutable</code>（可变，需显式选择）。两条线之上是一组共享的抽象 trait——<code>Iterable</code>、<code>Seq</code>、<code>Set</code>、<code>Map</code>——它们定义了 <code>map</code>/<code>filter</code>/<code>fold</code> 等几乎所有集合通用的变换操作。这种「统一接口 + 双实现线」的设计，让你用一套词汇操作所有集合，又能在需要时精确选择可变性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Iterable 顶层抽象] --&gt; B[Seq 有序序列]&#10;  A --&gt; C[Set 不重复集合]&#10;  A --&gt; D[Map 键值映射]&#10;  B --&gt; E[List 不可变链表]&#10;  B --&gt; F[Vector 不可变索引序列]&#10;  B --&gt; G[mutable.ArrayBuffer 可变缓冲]&#10;  E --&gt; H[共享尾部的持久化结构]&#10;  F --&gt; I[32 叉 trie 持久化结构]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Iterable 顶层抽象] --&gt; B[Seq 有序序列]\n  A --&gt; C[Set 不重复集合]\n  A --&gt; D[Map 键值映射]\n  B --&gt; E[List 不可变链表]\n  B --&gt; F[Vector 不可变索引序列]\n  B --&gt; G[mutable.ArrayBuffer 可变缓冲]\n  E --&gt; H[共享尾部的持久化结构]\n  F --&gt; I[32 叉 trie 持久化结构]</pre><p>下表对比几种最常用集合的性能与适用场景，是日常选型的依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集合</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n<th>随机访问</th>\n<th>头部插入</th>\n<th>尾部追加</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>List</code></td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>递归、栈式处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vector</code></td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通用索引序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LazyList</code></td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>无限/惰性序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ArrayBuffer</code></td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>摊还 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>局部性能热点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>immutable.Map</code></td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>通用映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么默认不可变\">为什么默认不可变</h2><p>不可变集合的核心承诺是：一旦创建，内容永不改变。任何「修改」操作都返回一个新集合，原集合纹丝不动。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/oop-fp-fusion\">面向对象与函数式融合</a> 里 case class <code>copy</code> 思想在集合上的体现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"val a = List(1, 2, 3)&#10;val b = 0 :: a       // 前插：得到 List(0, 1, 2, 3)&#10;// a 仍是 List(1, 2, 3)，完全没变&#10;&#10;val m = Map(&quot;x&quot; -&gt; 1)&#10;val m2 = m + (&quot;y&quot; -&gt; 2)  // 得到新 Map，m 不受影响\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val a = List(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val b = 0 :: a       // 前插：得到 List(0, 1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// a 仍是 List(1, 2, 3)，完全没变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val m = Map(\"x\" -> 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val m2 = m + (\"y\" -> 2)  // 得到新 Map，m 不受影响</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不可变带来三个工程红利。其一是线程安全：多个线程读同一个不可变集合永远不会有竞态，这是 <a href=\"../ecosystem/concurrency-effects\">并发与效应系统</a> 能放心共享数据的基础。其二是可推理性：你看到一个 <code>val xs</code>，就能确定它在任何后续代码里都是同一份值，不必担心被某个远处的方法偷偷改掉。其三是安全共享：把集合传给别人不必防御性拷贝。代价是每次「修改」都产生新对象——而持久化数据结构正是用来把这个代价压到极低的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"持久化数据结构-不可变为何不昂贵\">持久化数据结构：不可变为何不昂贵</h2><p>如果每次给 100 万元素的 Vector 加一个元素都要完整复制一份，不可变就会贵到不可用。Scala 用持久化数据结构（persistent data structure）避免了这一点：新版本与旧版本共享绝大部分底层结构，只复制改动路径上的少量节点，这叫结构共享（structural sharing）。</p>\n<p>以 <code>List</code> 为例，它是单向链表，前插一个元素只需新建一个节点指向原表头，原表整个被新表共享——所以前插是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且不复制任何旧元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"val a = List(2, 3)       // a → 2 → 3&#10;val b = 1 :: a           // b → 1 → 2 → 3，其中「2 → 3」与 a 共享\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val a = List(2, 3)       // a → 2 → 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val b = 1 :: a           // b → 1 → 2 → 3，其中「2 → 3」与 a 共享</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Vector</code> 更精巧，它底层是一棵分支因子为 32 的平衡 trie（数组前缀树）。更新一个元素只需复制从根到该叶子的那一条路径（高度约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_{32} n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，百万级数据也只有四五层），其余子树原样共享。于是随机访问、更新、追加都做到了实践中接近常数的复杂度。理解结构共享，你就理解了为什么 Scala 能把「不可变」从一种理论上的优雅做成一种工程上的默认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用集合操作替代循环\">用集合操作替代循环</h2><p>不可变集合配合统一的高阶变换接口，让你几乎不必再写显式循环。这些变换是 <a href=\"higher-order-monads\">高阶函数与 Monad</a> 一篇的主角，这里先看它们如何重塑日常代码的形状：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"case class Order(user: String, amount: Int)&#10;val orders = List(Order(&quot;a&quot;, 30), Order(&quot;b&quot;, 50), Order(&quot;a&quot;, 20))&#10;&#10;// 命令式：建可变 map、循环累加（略）&#10;// 函数式：声明式地表达「按用户汇总金额」&#10;val byUser: Map[String, Int] =&#10;  orders.groupBy(_.user)&#10;        .view.mapValues(_.map(_.amount).sum)&#10;        .toMap&#10;// Map(&quot;a&quot; -&gt; 50, &quot;b&quot; -&gt; 50)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>case class Order(user: String, amount: Int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val orders = List(Order(\"a\", 30), Order(\"b\", 50), Order(\"a\", 20))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 命令式：建可变 map、循环累加（略）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 函数式：声明式地表达「按用户汇总金额」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val byUser: Map[String, Int] =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  orders.groupBy(_.user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .view.mapValues(_.map(_.amount).sum)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .toMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Map(\"a\" -> 50, \"b\" -> 50)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码没有一处可变状态、没有一个循环变量，读起来就是问题本身的描述：分组、对每组的金额求和。<code>groupBy</code>、<code>map</code>、<code>sum</code> 都来自集合的统一接口，对 List、Vector、Set 写法完全一致。当数据需要解构判断时，它们还会和 <a href=\"pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a> 自然组合。这种「数据流动而非状态改写」的风格，正是函数式章想让你内化的核心直觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Scala 集合分 immutable（默认推荐）与 mutable 两条线，共享 <code>Iterable</code>/<code>Seq</code>/<code>Set</code>/<code>Map</code> 抽象与统一的 <code>map</code>/<code>filter</code>/<code>fold</code> 接口。</li>\n<li>不可变默认带来线程安全、可推理性与安全共享，是并发与函数式风格的基础。</li>\n<li>持久化数据结构靠结构共享让不可变高效：<code>List</code> 前插 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>Vector</code> 基于 32 叉 trie 实现近似常数的访问与更新。</li>\n<li>选型上 <code>List</code> 适合递归、<code>Vector</code> 是通用默认、<code>ArrayBuffer</code> 留给局部性能热点。</li>\n<li>集合的高阶变换让你用声明式代码替代循环，深入展开见 <a href=\"higher-order-monads\">高阶函数与 Monad</a>，与解构配合见 <a href=\"pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不可变与集合","id":"不可变与集合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么默认不可变","id":"为什么默认不可变"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化数据结构：不可变为何不昂贵","id":"持久化数据结构-不可变为何不昂贵"},{"level":2,"text":"用集合操作替代循环","id":"用集合操作替代循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型推断基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/scala-language/foundations/type-inference-basics"},"next":{"title":"模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/scala-language/functional/pattern-matching"}}